    "52dd896460b97ca9dc9b6bd9a309dadc98f582b895cb62b623f751bf9f8da567": {
      "decision": "warn",
      "note": "Compared the frozen Basalt EN source renderings at desktop, laptop, tablet, mobile and narrow-mobile widths (original HTML 2400015139...) with the nine normal-state JP target screenshots (Chromium at all five widths; Firefox and WebKit at desktop and mobile). Preserved in every layout: the near-white page ground with dark body text, the SCP Foundation header with logo and icon-only search and account controls, the hamburger row at narrow widths, the title rule, the rating module, Basalt heading treatment and the shell-to-content information hierarchy. Documented localization differences: Japanese fixture content and glyphs replace the EN text; Firefox and WebKit render wider Latin fallback glyphs. WARN: the frozen source replay still records four unavailable external assets (loading indicator, two Nanum fonts, classification logo), so exact asset and font fidelity is only partially evidenced. This normal-state question does not settle the open-menu composition states, which are separate questions.",
      "evidence_sha256": "14348e19700f1a3d45523696ce4704e9596237e5ac366701b3bd6723fac70d51",
